      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Postoperative pain management continues to be a challenge to health care professionals. To address this, hospitals across the country are developing Acute Pain Services. It is fast becoming a specialty area and is being incorporated into the realm of practice of anesthesiologists. As postanesthesia nurses, we are in a unique position to enter this new field."},
